Key Takeaways

1. Agreement Lifecycle Tracking

The AI solution should:

Capture agreement start date and tenure.
Automatically calculate agreement end date.
Determine whether an agreement is currently active.
Provide alerts and notifications before agreement expiry.
Display agreements nearing expiry in dashboards. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]
2. Agreement Completeness Validation

The solution should determine:

Whether both parties have signed the agreement.
Whether required signatures exist.
Whether agreement execution is complete.
The team discussed using the signature page and final pages of agreements as key indicators. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]

3. Business Rationale Identification

The chatbot should identify:

Why parties entered into the agreement.
The business justification and commercial intent.
The strategic benefit of the transaction.
The discussion clarified that this is different from transaction nature; the requirement is to identify the business need behind the agreement. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]

4. Nature of Activities / Transactions

The AI should classify and extract:[ >>]  @PAWASKAR PRATIK : Please guide on the transactions as captured in the RPT portal.

Purchase transactions
Sale transactions
Service arrangements
Design services
Other transaction categories covered by the agreement
The team noted that interpretation may be required because clauses may not always explicitly state the transaction category. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]

5. Commercials and Pricing Mechanism

The solution should identify:

Pricing mechanisms
Payment terms
Cost structures
Mark-up percentages
Commercial clauses
and make them easily searchable. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]

6. Agreement Summarization

The chatbot should create:

Key-point summaries
Executive summaries
Condensed agreement overviews while retaining key terms and obligations. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]
7. Query Management

Users should be able to ask natural language questions against agreements and receive intelligent responses. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]

8. Transfer Pricing (TP) Policy Validation

A significant requirement discussed was:

Upload TP policy documents.
Compare agreements against TP policy guidance.
Validate pricing methodologies.
Check mark-up ranges against approved TP benchmarks.
Highlight deviations. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]
9. Agreement Comparison

The system should compare multiple similar agreements and identify:

Missing clauses
Changes in terms
Inconsistencies
New clauses introduced in later agreements
This could support agreement standardization across Mahindra entities. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]

10. Compliance Monitoring & Dashboarding

The solution should:

Validate RPT-approved transactions against agreements.
Highlight missing agreements.
Highlight approved transactions not covered by agreements.
Generate compliance dashboards.
Track agreements requiring future actions such as actualization exercises. [Agreements...d linkages | Meeting]
